<title>UK: GOLF-PUNTERS ABANDON BALLESTEROS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-PUNTERS ABANDON BALLESTEROS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three times champion Seve Ballesteros has attracted only 16 pounds ($27) in bets to win this year's British Open, a British bookmaker said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;It is very poignant that Seve, who was in many respects the original Tiger Woods, is now being ignored by the same punters who are rushing to back Tiger as though defeat were out of the question,&quot; said William Hill spokesman Graham Sharpe.</p>
<p>Ballesteros was quoted at 200-1 with Woods clear favourite at 5-1.</p>
</text>
